void presenting a partial load as complete."},{"fromQuestion":"Q15","fromSpan":["I-11"],"id":"ASM-10","risk":"low","text":"Should the demo/project area include an overview of the prompts used to build the solution, in addition to the requested testing, challenges, readiness, and go-to-market material? → assumed: Omit prompt history; include the requested demo, testing/validation, challenges, production-readiness, and go-to-market material."}],"conflicts":[],"differences":[{"id":"D-1","readings":[{"behaviour":1,"sketch":1,"summary":"Tracks PO-line-to-lot splits with assigned quantities and traceability, but does not specify permissions, unmatched-record handling, or capacity enforcement."},{"behaviour":3,"sketch":2,"summary":"Restricts import and mapping to authorized users; unauthorized users can only view permitted data."},{"behaviour":5,"sketch":2,"summary":"Keeps unmapped records out of pen operations and rejects or flags over-capacity assignments."},{"behaviour":4,"sketch":3,"summary":"Identifies duplicate imports and avoids silently double-counting animals, receipts, or costs."}],"span":"I-1","topic":"Procurement import and mapping controls"},{"id":"D-2","readings":[{"behaviour":1,"sketch":1,"summary":"Refreshes forecasts using current weight-gain performance when available."},{"behaviour":0,"sketch":2,"summary":"Uses a configured gain assumption for the projected target-weight date."},{"behaviour":1,"sketch":3,"summary":"Lets users update and retain a target weight or ADG assumption with the forecast."}],"span":"I-2","topic":"Forecast assumptions and gain-rate source"},{"id":"D-3","readings":[{"behaviour":1,"sketch":1,"summary":"Records opening stock, receipts, consumption, wastage, and closing stock as identifiable movements."},{"behaviour":1,"sketch":2,"summary":"Records receipts, adjustments, and wastage as dated, attributable movements."},{"behaviour":3,"sketch":2,"summary":"Flags items projected to run low or out of stock within a selected horizon."},{"be